	<section_number>1-209</section_number>
	<catch_line>Collegial body</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Collegial body" means a governmental entity whose power or authority is vested within its membership.
	</text>
	<history>2004, c. 651, § 1-13.4:1; 2005, c. 839.</history>
